    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The prevalence of urinary incontinence in Asia has been reported to be around 14.6% in females and 6.8% in males. There is an increased risk of incontinence in old age, among females, multiparity, history of pelvic surgery, lower urinary tract surgery, obesity and neurological disease.",
